  - elementId: spectrum-caption
    elementType: text
    bounds: [540, 480, 356, 26]
    content:
      fontSize: 9.5
      color: "$muted"
      lineHeight: 1.35
      align: [center, top]
      text: |
        <p>The concept-model rung is the output of <strong><span style="color:$ink">domain modeling</span></strong> - e.g., a diagram of Party, Delivery Ticket, and Invoice, with Party playing its roles</p>

  # ---------- footer ----------
  - elementId: footer-left
